  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Victims&apos; Voices Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2	OBJECTIVES OF THE PROJECT 
IMPACT
Prevent (support for) extremist violence, terrorism and the ISIS narrative in Indonesia.


The planned effects for the target group of the Project are: 

OUTCOME 1 
Convicted terrorists, deportees &amp; returnees reintegrating into society post engagement are dissuaded from returning to ISIS affiliated and other terrorist networks.

OUTCOME 2 
